1. 💫 Climax Overlay Par Floating Hearts & Confetti
Abhi kya hota hai: Jab "One Last Secret Just For You" click hota hai tou background canvas par firework burst hota hai, lekin popup ke peeche backdrop-filter: blur hone ki waja se woh asar chup jata hai.
Behtari: Popup khulte hi screen ke samne 3D floating hearts, golden sparkles aur cinematic glowing petals barasne chahiyein. Is se Bilal ke liye yeh moment 10x zyada visually emotional lagega.

2. 📸 Polaroid Modal Mein Asli Photos Ka Lightbox View
Abhi kya hota hai: Polaroid click karne par modal khulta hai jisme sirf emoji icon aur story aati hai, actual tasweer modal mein nahi aati.
Behtari: Modal ke andar upar wahi photo (pic (1).jpg, etc.) aik pyare glowing frame mein show ho aur neeche uski date aur kahani likhi ho. Mobile par photo ko zoom/fullscreen dekhne ka option bhi diya ja sakta hai.

3. 💓 Mobile Haptic Feedback (Asli Dil Ki Dharkan)
Feature: Jab Scene 4 mein Bilal "Hold To Sync Our Heartbeats" button ko press karke rakhega, tou agar woh phone par use kar raha ho tou hum navigator.vibrate ke zariye phone mein real heartbeat vibration (dhak-dhak) produce kar sakte hain!
Is se user ko waqayi feel hoga ke heartbeat synchronize ho rahi hai.

4. ✨ Mouse / Touch Trail (Sparkles & Tiny Hearts)
Feature: Cursor glow ke sath jab mouse move ho ya mobile par screen ko touch kar ke scroll karein, tou peeche chhotey chhotey chamakte huwe sitare ya faint floating hearts ban kar fade out hon. Yeh experience ko bohot interactive banata hai.

5. 🎵 Audio Crossfade (Cinematic Music Transition)
Abhi kya hota hai: Climax button dabane par background music foran cut ho kar band hota hai aur Bilal-song.mp3 shuru hota hai.
Behtari: Background music 1 second mein smoothly fade-out ho aur climax song fade-in ho kar loud ho, bilkul movie scenes ki tarah. Sath hi audio button par chhota sa song title indicator ("🎵 Playing: Our Special Song") dikhaya ja sakta hai.

6. 💌 "Save As Keepsake" (Download Letter / Card as Image/PDF)
Feature: Love Letter ya Climax ke andar aik chhota sa elegant button: "Save Our Story as Keepsake", jis par click karne se Bilal is pure letter ko aik beautiful framed photo/PDF ke tor par apne phone mein download kar ke hamesha ke liye save kar sake.

7. 🌟 "Send a Wish" Persistent Counter
Abhi Scene 6 mein "Send a Wish" button click karne par count refresh hone se reset ho jata hai. Isay localStorage mein save kiya ja sakta hai taake Bilal jitni dafa bhi visit kare aur wish send kare, woh count hamesha grow karta rahe.
Aap in mein se pehle kya add karwana chahte hain?
Floating Hearts & Confetti + Audio Fade (Climax enhance karne ke liye)?
Polaroids ka photo lightbox modal?
Mobile Heartbeat Vibration + Touch Sparkles Trail?
Ya aapke zehen mein koi aur specific idea hai jo aap add karna chahte hain?